        "unknown_parts": [],
        "why": "dpv:Marketing skos:narrower dpv:DirectMarketing reads as DirectMarketing ⊑ Marketing, so the prohibition's constraint is T and the prohibition applies (due2-profiles.md §4, §6). Under conflict prohibit it removes the permission: Deny."
